Adaptation (internal/model/v41_config_deepinfer_parity_test.go): a Go contract
test applies DeepInfer derivation rules to fak's committed dba1be0a fixture. It
transcribes DeepInfer's nearest-source map, index-K fallback to KV sources,
candidate-source range, attention module list, prefill boundary invariants,
NoPE/HC/window widths and vision encoder constants, and compares them with
fak's V4.1 attention plan resolution, per-layer rotary policy, mHC stream row
and retained vision metadata. It is test-only evidence with no runtime change,
and it makes no claim about any other published V4.1 config.
